{"id":"00235","root":"uni00235_1","name":{"ja":"仲森　奈々華","en":"Nakamori Nanaka"},"title":null,"displayName":{"ja":"仲森　奈々華","en":"Nakamori Nanaka"},"element":"Superhuman","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","roles":[],"traits":["Taimanin"],"release":"2019-08-31","limited":false,"characterId":174,"profile":{"ja":"五車学園を卒業したばかりの駆け出し対魔忍。驚異の耐久力と回復力を持つ忍法【鉄壁覚醒】を頼りに前線に飛び込んでいく戦闘特化タイプ。見た目は普通の人間と変わらないが、刃物や銃器の攻撃を受けてもかすり傷程度しか負わない。また回復能力も高く、常人なら致命傷になるほどの傷を受けても一晩寝ればほぼ回復している。これによりオーバーワークになるような訓練も平然とこなし、対魔忍の中でもかなり高い筋力を誇る。その能力から先輩である紫とよく比較され、本人も紫の事を尊敬している。ただ奈々華の能力はあくまで耐久、回復であり、切断された肉体を修復するようなことはできない。性格は明るく前向きだが、猪突猛進の気があり、敵を目の前にすると後先考えずに突っ込んでしまう。その能力で、全ての戦場から生還しているが、常人なら何回も死んでいる、戦い方を見直せと指示されている。本人も自制しようと考えているが、戦闘となるとなかなか闘争心を抑えられない。とはいえ努力を欠かさず、誰に対しても明るく接する彼女は仲間達には好かれていて、戦闘時には嫌な顔をせずフォローしてもらえている。","en":"Nakamori Nanaka has just graduated from Gosha Academy and is a rookie Taimanin. She relies on the ninja art \"Iron Wall Awakening,\" which gives her astonishing durability and regeneration, and throws herself into the front lines as a combat-focused type. She looks like an ordinary human, but blades or bullets only leave superficial scratches. Her healing is so rapid that wounds fatal to normal people are almost fully recovered after a night's sleep. This lets her handle over-work training with ease and she boasts remarkably high strength among Taimanin. Because of this, seniors often compare her to Yatsu Murasaki, whom she respects. However, Nanaka's ability is limited to durability and recovery; she cannot repair severed flesh. Her personality is bright and forward-looking, though she can be head-strong, charging at enemies without thinking. Thanks to her abilities she has survived every battlefield, though a normal person would have died many times, prompting orders to rethink her tactics. She tries to restrain herself, but in combat her fighting spirit is hard to curb. Nevertheless, she never slacks, treats everyone cheerfully, and is liked by her comrades, who gladly support her without a sour look during fights."},"illustrator":"西條サトル","voiceActor":"葉月あかり","forms":[{"id":"uni00235_1","rarity":2,"rarityLabel":"R","levelMax":50,"stats":{"hp":[950,1900],"sp":[170,170],"atk":[104,208],"def":[80,160],"spd":[47,47],"luck":[1,80]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["1","300009"]},{"id":"uni00235_2","rarity":3,"rarityLabel":"HR","levelMax":60,"stats":{"hp":[1500,3000],"sp":[230,230],"atk":[158,316],"def":[110,220],"spd":[47,47],"luck":[1,80]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["1","300009","300010"]},{"id":"uni00235_3","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[2050,4123],"sp":[340,340],"atk":[212,421],"def":[140,283],"spd":[47,47],"luck":[1,80]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["1","300009","300010"]}],"skills":{"1":{"slot":"attack","id":1,"name":null,"hits":1,"cutin":false,"levels":[{"level":1,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"超人属性ダメージ"}},{"level":2,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"超人属性ダメージ"}},{"level":3,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"超人属性ダメージ"}},{"level":4,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"超人属性ダメージ"}},{"level":5,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"超人属性ダメージ"}}],"effects":[{"text":"1 enemy: 100% Superhuman damage"}]},"300009":{"slot":"skill1","id":300009,"name":{"ja":"鉄壁覚醒・回復"},"hits":1,"cutin":false,"levels":[{"level":1,"sp":170,"detail":{"ja":"自身のHPを大回復する"}},{"level":2,"sp":165,"detail":{"ja":"自身のHPを大回復する"}},{"level":3,"sp":160,"detail":{"ja":"自身のHPを大回復する"}},{"level":4,"sp":155,"detail":{"ja":"自身のHPを大回復する"}},{"level":5,"sp":150,"detail":{"ja":"自身のHPを大回復する"}}],"effects":[{"text":"Self: restore 40% HP","icon":"Healing_hp"}]},"300010":{"slot":"skill2","id":300010,"name":{"ja":"大上段薙"},"hits":1,"cutin":true,"levels":[{"level":1,"sp":230,"detail":{"ja":"敵１体に特大威力で攻撃する"}},{"level":2,"sp":230,"detail":{"ja":"敵１体に特大威力で攻撃する"}},{"level":3,"sp":230,"detail":{"ja":"敵１体に特大威力で攻撃する"}},{"level":4,"sp":230,"detail":{"ja":"敵１体に特大威力で攻撃する"}},{"level":5,"sp":230,"detail":{"ja":"敵１体に特大威力で攻撃する"}}],"effects":[{"text":"1 enemy: 560% Superhuman damage"}]}},"leader":{"name":{"ja":"鉄壁覚醒"},"detail":{"ja":"超人属性ユニットのDEFを小アップ"},"effects":[{"text":"Superhum