],[45,"blo00010",5],[45,"blo00013",5],[46,"blo00001",640],[46,"blo00004",2],[47,"blo00007",5],[47,"blo00009",1],[47,"blo00010",5],[47,"blo00012",1],[47,"blo00013",5],[47,"blo00015",1],[48,"blo00007",5],[48,"blo00009",1],[48,"blo00010",5],[48,"blo00012",1],[48,"blo00013",5],[48,"blo00015",1],[49,"blo00007",5],[49,"blo00009",1],[49,"blo00010",5],[49,"blo00012",1],[49,"blo00013",5],[49,"blo00015",1],[50,"blo00007",5],[50,"blo00009",1],[50,"blo00010",5],[50,"blo00012",1],[50,"blo00013",5],[50,"blo00015",1]]},"voices":[{"type":"new","label":"Acquired","variant":"base","index":1,"text":{"ja":"仲森奈々華です！　切り込み役ならお任せください！","en":"I'm Nanaka Nakamori! If you need a front-line attacker, leave it to me!"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00235_1/uni00235_1_new_1.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":1,"text":{"ja":"私のほうが先輩なんですからね、ちゃんと敬語を使ってくださいよ？","en":"I'm the senior here, so please use proper honorifics, okay?"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00235_1/uni00235_1_hom_1.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":2,"text":{"ja":"憧れの対魔忍？　もちろん紫先生です、とっても尊敬しています！","en":"My idol Taimanin? Of course it's Sensei Yatsu, I really look up to her!"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00235_1/uni00235_1_hom_2.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":3,"text":{"ja":"そろそろ次の任務ですね……大丈夫、私が先陣を切りますから、しっかりついてきてください","en":"It's about time for the next mission... Don't worry, I'll take the lead, so stay right behind me."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00235_1/uni00235_1_hom_3.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":4,"text":{"ja":"いったたた……うーん、突っ込みすぎたかな……","en":"Ouch... hmm, maybe I overdid it..."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00235_1/uni00235_1_hom_4.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":5,"text":{"ja":"悪い部分はよく指摘されるんですけど、なかなか直らないんですよね……","en":"My bad points get pointed out a lot, but they don't really improve..."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00235_1/uni00235_1_hom_5.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":6,"text":{"ja":"さぁ、行きますよ！　私が全員、片づけてあげますから！","en":"Alright, let's go! I'll clean up everyone for you!"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00235_1/uni00235_1_hom_6.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":7,"text":{"ja":"ふぅ～、いい戦いでしたね。また次も、頑張りましょう！","en":"Whew, that was a great battle. Let's give it our all again next time!"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00235_1/uni00235_1_hom_7.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00235_1/uni00235_1_atk_1.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00235_1/uni00235_1_atk_2.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":3,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00235_1/uni00235_1_atk_3.ogg"},{"type":"dmg","label":"Damaged","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00235_1/uni00235_1_dmg_1.ogg"},{"type":"dmg","label":"Damaged","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00235_1/uni00235_1_dmg_2.ogg"},{"type":"dmg","label":"Damaged","variant":"base","index":3,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00235_1/uni00235_1_dmg_3.ogg"},{"type":"evo","label":"Awakening","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00235_1/uni00235_1_evo_1.ogg"},{"type":"evo","label":"Awakening","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00235_1/uni00235_1_evo_2.ogg"},{"type":"lup","label":"Level Up","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00235_1/uni00235_1_lup_1.ogg"},{"type":"msr","label":"Mission","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00235_1/uni00235_1_msr_1.ogg"},{"type":"msr","label":"Mission","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00235_1/uni00235_1_msr_2.ogg"},{"type":"rdy","label":"Battle Start","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00235_1/uni00235_1_rdy_1.ogg"},{"type":"rdy","label":"Battle Start","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00235_1/uni00235_1_rdy_2.ogg"},{"typ